# hui walk-speed measure (14z-66, playtest round-1 item 2). Forced-pick
# flow, then a short steady FORWARD walk measured early — before P1
# reaches the opponent's push box (~150px away; contact would compress
# the delta). The harness dumps P1 X as 16.16 fixed point (ff8410-ff8414)
# at f3060/f3075/f3090: each 15-frame window's exact delta = 15 * the
# param32_a forward velocity (alias row 0x30000 -> 0x2D0000; his true
# 0x32000 -> 0x2EE000). Only the forward half discriminates: his back
# velocity equals the alias content (both 0xfffd4000, measured).
300-305 sys=C1
800-803 sys=S1
1700-1702 p1=1
3050-3200 p1=R
4000 wait
